    {
      "bbox": [
        637,
        579,
        1230,
        1233
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Annual Financial Reporting of\nNet Worth and Income Required. (i) The Mayor,\ndeputy mayors, agency heads, deputy agency heads,\n(ii) city employees in mayoral agencies who serve\nin the exempt or noncompetitive classes of civil\nservice or who are provisional appointees [and\nwhose duties], if the duties of such employees\ndirectly involve the negotiation, authorization or\napproval of contracts, leases, franchises, revocable\nconsents, concessions and applications for zoning\nchanges, variances and special permits, and (iii)\nany other city employees in mayoral agencies who\nserve in the exempt or noncompetitive classes of\ncivil service or who are provisional appointees,\nwho are requested by the Department of\nInvestigation to comply with the provisions of this\nOrder, shall annually file with the Department of\nInvestigation a report on such form as shall be\nprovided, setting forth assets and liabilities held\nduring that year and the income received during\nthe same period, by the employee and his or her\nspouse. This annual report shall be filed for each\ncalendar year and shall be submitted to the\nDepartment of Investigation no later than\nMarch 15 of the following year. For calendar\nyear 1985, reports shall be filed no later than",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2686,
          "min": -1.3337
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0013,
          "min": -0.0013
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 275,
          "mean": -0.0045,
          "min": -0.478
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 82816,
        "area_px": 387696,
        "density": 0.21361,
        "chars": 1247,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 15.06
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        599,
        1247,
        1188,
        1424
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "5:00 p.m. on [September 15] September 19, 1986.\nPersons leaving city service shall file a report for\nthe previous year, if they have not already done\nso, and for that portion of the calendar year in\nwhich they served in office, within 60 days of\nseparation of service or by March 15 of the\nfollowing year, whichever is earlier.",
